      "text": "- foundation layer cannot log or\ncannot import a logger. That is a\npolicy and is going to be too\nrestrictive. Foundation packages\ncould potentially go into their own\nrepo one day",
      "fontSize": 22.293902406452826,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- foundation layer cannot log or cannot import a logger. That is a policy and is going to be too restrictive. Foundation packages could potentially go into their own repo one day",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
